{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it was on the eighth day.</b> We find a call for abundance — as it is said: ״וקראתי אל הדגן והרביתי אותו״. A call for famine — as it is said: ״כי קרא ה' לרעב״. A call for greatness — as it is said: ״קרא משה לאהרן ולבניו״. And Moses said to him: Thus the Holy One, blessed be He, said to me — to appoint you as High Priest, and I rejoice with you in your greatness just as you rejoiced in my greatness, as it is said: ״וראך ושמח בלבו״." "<b>And to the elders of Israel.</b> In order to magnify him before them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:52.273513117Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}